WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
My family lineage is settlers from the 1500s.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.320
Colonialists.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.160
Yeah, colonialists.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.080
You don't look very Native American to me.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.040
I am Native American.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.160
Whites are Native Americans.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.000
What are you talking about?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.820
Sorry, you're not.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:10.660
What are you talking about?

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.800
You're a little bit more than a far right Republican.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.280
Hey, what can I say?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.880
I think you can say I'm a fascist.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:16.719
Yeah, I am.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.700
Listen to me.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.520
I am an immigrant.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.360
I'm speaking from personal experience.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.200
Get the hell out.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.160
I don't even like, I should get the hell out.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:24.980
Yes.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:25.820
Why?

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:26.660
I don't want you here.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:27.480
I'm Mehdi Hassan.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.320
I'm a journalist.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.200
I'm the editor of Zoteo.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.660
And today I'm surrounded by 20 far right conservatives.

